      {
        "new": "`structural_maps/paid_reference.rs` owns the finite selected reference-coverage\nreceiver: actual vector/node wrappers prepay their own same-ledger receiving\nbefore arguments, while complete old validators remain independent. It carries\nclosed refusal data and does not grant report, source or payer authority.\n",
        "old": ""
      },
      {
        "new": "| HIR | `src/hir.rs`, `src/hir/` \u2014 `ids.rs`, `nodes.rs`, and `expr_nodes.rs` own the data model; `ids/instance_match.rs` owns prepaid exact streaming comparison at retained-instance validation predicates; `nodes/instance_key.rs` retains the original key traversal with a root completeness destination and `bounded_output/checked_string.rs` observes its actual omitted writes, while public key construction, ordinary sinks and the complete allocating identity oracle remain unchanged; `resolve_*.rs` own AST lowering; `resolver_scope.rs` owns call-local borrowed-root Cow binding scopes and their complete-map mutation boundary; `borrowed_root_oracle/` retains the fixed test-only nonrecursive prior receiver and helper/frame bodies; `function_value.rs` owns independent callable target/signature validation; `validation.rs` owns core validation; `validation/canonical_loans.rs` independently rebuilds loan proof and retains each exact origin once behind private endpoint ordinals |\n",
        "old": "| HIR | `src/hir.rs`, `src/hir/` \u2014 `ids.rs`, `nodes.rs`, and `expr_nodes.rs` own the data model; `resolve_*.rs` own AST lowering; `resolver_scope.rs` owns call-local borrowed-root Cow binding scopes and their complete-map mutation boundary; `borrowed_root_oracle/` retains the fixed test-only nonrecursive prior receiver and helper/frame bodies; `function_value.rs` owns independent callable target/signature validation; `validation.rs` owns core validation; `validation/canonical_loans.rs` independently rebuilds loan proof and retains each exact origin once behind private endpoint ordinals |\n"
      }
